    "bodyText": "Have any questions? call us\n+1 (201) 687-1074\n\t\n\t\n\t\nClick To Call Now!\nServices\nAbout\nFAQs\nResources\nFinancing\nContact\n\t\n\nWe specialize in Residential & Light Commercial HVAC Service, Installs, Replacements, & Maintenance.\n\nMost importantly, we offer vital Preventative Maintenance Plans to fit any, and all budgets.\n\nThe professionals at Urban Mechanical know that your Home or Business are sanctuaries of comfort and peace. Which means that it’s a focus of importance for us to help you maintain comfortable and ideal temperatures. If you’re in need of HVAC services, or just want more information about how we can help with any other issues, please contact us today! Our skilled technicians are always ready to help you! We can talk through some possible solutions over the phone before making any decisions. We provide excellent customer service by offering fast response times coupled with the commitment of communication during all aspects of our time together. We are available for both your Heating and Cooling repairs, replacements, and installations. And most importantly, we offer vital preventive maintenance plans to fit any and all budgets.\n\n100% Financing Available!\nCheck out our great financing options here.\n\nWith approved credit through Synchrony Financing homeowners are eligible for fixed interest rates, flexible terms, and affordable monthly payments that fit their budget.\n\nGET APPROVED\nGET APPROVED\n\nEasy and affordable payment options for all credit score levels. Get back to comfort fast with FTL Finance. Complete the single online application for real-time financing options.\n\nGET APPROVED\nGET APPROVED\nServicing homes in the NJ area for over a decade!\nCounties we service\nEssex County • Union County\n• Passaic County • Bergen County\n• Hudson County\nLet us help keep you and\nyour loved ones comfortable!\nCall Today\nCall Today\nHEATING & COOLING SERVICES\nOur extensive HVAC knowledge and array of services guarantee year-round comfort for homes and commercial businesses alike.\nAIR CONDITIONING\n\nAC repair, AC installation,\nand AC maintenance.\n\nLearn more\nHEATING\n\nHeat pump and furnace repair, installation, and maintenance.\n\nLearn more\nINDOOR AIR QUALITY\n\nBreathe easier with our indoor air quality services and products.\n\nLearn more\nCOMMERCIAL HVAC\n\nCommercial HVAC repair, installation, and maintenance.\n\nLearn more\nMAINTENANCE\n\nAffordable HVAC maintenance and maintenance plans\n\nLearn more\nOur latest projects\n Follow on Instagram\n© 2022 Urban Mechanical. All Rights Reserved. Designed & Powered By Rolesville Design Co",
