      "owners": [],
      "bodyText": "Have any questions? call us\n+1 (201) 687-1074\n\t\n\t\n\t\nClick To Call Now!\nServices\nAbout\nFAQs\nResources\nFinancing\nContact\n\t\nAbout\nABOUT\nABOUT US\nEverything there is to know about us!\n\nUrban Mechanical has been leading the way in Residential and Light Commercial HVAC Services throughout northern New Jersey since 2008. For over a decade, we've been helping Homeowners and Business owners throughout the area with affordable and reliable work on their Heating, Cooling, and Indoor Air Quality needs. We have been fully committed to providing quality services for reasonable and affordable prices.\n\n \n\nHere at Urban Mechanical, we also believe that no one should be without a reliable HVAC Service Provider. Regardless of your budget, Urban Mechanical is committed to providing you with the services that you and your HVAC equipment deserve! We understand that a clean, safe, and properly running HVAC system is essential to the health of the occupants of your home or even at your business. That's why we pride ourselves on offering affordable HVAC solutions for all things related to your HVAC needs. Also, we are honored to offer you 100% financing for things like repairs, replacements, and completely new HVAC system installations.\n\n \n\nAt Urban Mechanical, we understand that a company is only good as their word. That's why we offer a one-year labor guarantee on the services that we perform for our clients. Regardless the size of the job, large whether it's large or small, at your home or business you will get great service at an affordable price. And for Commercial clients, we offer annual service contracts to make sure that they get the regular scheduled maintenance to keep their HVAC equipment running at peak performance throughout the year\n\nWhat We Do\nCentral Air Conditioners\nHot-Air Furnaces\nHeat Pumps\nHot Water & Steam Boilers\nDuctless Mini-Split Systems\nIndoor air quality products\nThermostats and controls\nLet us help you keep you cool!\n\nWhen things get hot (or don't get hot) we can help!\n\nCall Today\nCall Today\n© 2022 Urban Mechanical. All Rights Reserved. Designed & Powered By Rolesville Design Co",
